"#800000\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"1\" width=\"641\">\n<tr>\n<td height=\"12\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"20%\"><p align=\"CENTER\"><font color=\"#800000\">Date of\n    Remittances into Treasury or Sub-Treasury</font></p></td>\n<td height=\"12\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"20%\"><font color=\"#800000\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Name of\n    Treasury or Sub-Treasury</p></font></td>\n<td height=\"12\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"20%\"><font color=\"#800000\"><p align=\"CENTER\">By whom\n    Remitted</p></font></td>\n<td height=\"12\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"20%\"><font color=\"#800000\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Number of\n    each Chalan</p></font></td>\n<td height=\"12\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"20%\"><font color=\"#800000\"><p align=\"CENTER\">Amount\n    remitted with each Chalan</p></font></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"28\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"20%\"><font color=\"#800000\"><p align=\"CENTER\">1</p></font></td>\n<td height=\"28\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"20%\"><font color=\"#800000\"><p align=\"CENTER\">2</p></font></td>\n<td height=\"28\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"20%\"><font color=\"#800000\"><p align=\"CENTER\">3</p></font></td>\n<td height=\"28\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"20%\"><font color=\"#800000\"><p align=\"CENTER\">4</p></font></td>\n<td height=\"28\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"20%\"><font color=\"#800000\"><p align=\"CENTER\">5</p></font></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"244\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"20%\"></td>\n<td height=\"244\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"20%\"></td>\n<td height=\"244\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"20%\"></td>\n<td height=\"244\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"20%\"></td>\n<td height=\"244\" valign=\"TOP\" width=\"20%\"></td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<font color=\"#800000\" size=\"4\">\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Certified that the amount for which the C.T.R. is furnished agrees with\nthe amount credited in the Treasury accounts…………19 against\nI-Remittances except a small difference of Rs.................. which is explained\nbelow:—</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">(a) Rs ................ difference